WEBVTT

00:03:27.236 --> 00:03:30.316
we only have 67 percent
of the population vaccinated,

00:03:30.356 --> 00:03:32.276
we've got to do better than that.

00:03:32.276 --> 00:03:36.796
Of those, only one half
have gotten a single boost.

00:03:37.156 --> 00:03:38.716
And as a nation,

00:03:38.716 --> 00:03:42.236
we lag behind other developed countries

00:03:42.236 --> 00:03:45.996
and even some low-
and middle-income countries

00:03:46.036 --> 00:03:49.476
in the level of vaccinations
that we've been able to implement.

00:03:49.516 --> 00:03:52.916
So if you want to look it that way,
we have a lot of work to do,

00:03:52.956 --> 00:03:55.316
and that's exactly
what the President said.

00:03:55.996 --> 00:03:58.916
DB: So speaking of vaccines,
what's your advice?

00:03:58.956 --> 00:04:02.596
I know we have the bivalent available now.